, "credential_env": null, "detail": "The Google Patents public dataset is reachable only through BigQuery, which requires a Google Cloud project authenticated with Application Default Credentials or a service-account key plus the google-cloud-bigquery client library; Google documents no unauthenticated or free-key HTTP path to bigquery-public-data.google_patents. The runner uses the Python standard library only, so the candidate is dropped rather than adding a third-party dependency.", "endpoint": null, "kind": "dropped", "source": "google-patents-bigquery", "usable": false}, {"credential_configured": null, "credential_env": null, "detail": "The PatentsView Search API host does not exist: search.patentsview.org returns NXDOMAIN from the system resolver and from 1.1.1.1 and 8.8.8.8, and the legacy hosts api.patentsview.org and patentsview.org now serve the USPTO Open Data Portal single-page application instead of any PatentsView API reference. The legacy PatentsView API was retired and no reachable PatentsView request contract exists, so no endpoint or parameter is invented for it.", "endpoint": null, "kind": "dropped", "source": "patentsview", "usable": false}]}
